  "schema:name": "P4 · Scanned and checked",
  "schema:description": "Nurse Reem scans the code in the facility's EMR and enters the passcode. The EMR checks the signature with Malaysia's public key, fetched from GDHCN: the record really comes from Malaysia's HIE and has not been changed. Step 4 and step B of the overview of key process flows.",
